From 9a49214d876190f0d9a273203ea57e9fff5541cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kreijstal <rainb@tfwno.gf>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:10:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] wpfgfx: use standard template specialization and
 instantiation syntax

- define static members of class template specializations with
  template<> and through the class that declares them (MILRect.cpp,
  rtutils.cpp) or as a member of the primary template (DpiUtil.h)
- replace class-scope explicit specializations by overloads
  (shader_compiler_xm.hpp)
- declare explicit specializations before their first use, and cast
  T** to const T** explicitly (hwvertexbuffer.cpp)
- 'template class X<T>;' for explicit instantiations, and instantiate
  CalcProjectedBounds<PageInPixels>, which another file uses
- add missing 'typename' (d3dglyphpainter.cpp)
- no class-qualified constructor names inside the class
  (HwVertexBuffer.h, scanpipelinebuilder.hpp)
